Rollim is an [[NPC]] found in {{Zone|Scarleton}}. He requests for the player to fight him daily to train him for a duel against {{NPCSprite|Kaus}}. 

== Quest ==
Upon defeating him, he can be fought again after {{green|24 hours}}, getting progressively stronger until the final fight on the 7th day. After defeating him on the 7th day, he gives the player a {{Item|Bag of Gold}} as a reward for training him. The [[Bag of Gold]] sells for {{c|250,000}} to NPCs.

=== Training ===
'''Rollim''' will increase their [[Health]] each day, and deal increasing damage. 

'''Rollim''' will run towards the player and deal damage to them using a [[Wooden Sword]]. If the player is too far away, they will fire a few shots from their [[Bow]]. After 3/4 of their {{stat|hp}} has been depleted, they will eat a {{Item|Golden Apple}} to regenerate back up to 3/4 of their original [[Health]].

